{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Lumber Valley</i>, a game where you build your logging business from the ground up! Start with nothing but a basic axe and work your way up by cutting trees, processing wood, and fulfilling contracts to earn money and expand your operations. Explore the quarry and use the resources to upgrade your tools, improve your machines, and optimize your workflow to maximize efficiency. As you progress, invest in automation to streamline production, upgrade your skills to work faster, and unlock new opportunities that push your business to the next level.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563670?t=1752944557","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563670?t=1752944557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563670/4d881ffbc1ddbfe0ef66be4257cae39d8f5b620d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752944557","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563670/4d881ffbc1ddbfe0ef66be4257cae39d8f5b620d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752944557","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Lumber Valley</i>, a game where you build your logging business from the ground up! Start with nothing but a basic axe and work your way up by cutting trees, processing wood, and fulfilling contracts to earn money and expand your operations. Explore the quarry and use the resources to upgrade your tools, improve your machines, and optimize your workflow to maximize efficiency. As you progress, invest in automation to streamline production, upgrade your skills to work faster, and unlock new opportunities that push your business to the next level.</p>","developers":["Dairycow22"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"